WEBVTT

00:12:27.501 --> 00:12:48.601
(Muzike)

00:12:48.601 --> 00:12:52.228
Dhe shikoheni edhe njehere akordin final te pjeses,

00:12:52.228 --> 00:12:55.067
ne kete kohe roboti po komunikon me trupin e tij

00:12:55.067 --> 00:12:57.204
kur eshte i zene me pune.

00:12:57.204 --> 00:12:58.816
Dhe kur eshte gati

00:12:58.816 --> 00:13:02.168
te performoj akordin final me mua.